# sgo.build (schema: see core/sgo.build). wata-server is an APP over core + json.
# emitname is `wata` (the pre-6b shared-tree subdir .sgo/wata — the ci scripts
# reference it), while the module dir + binary are `wata-server`.
mode app
emitname wata
binname wata-server
gomod sgolawata
crosskey wata-server
optreport
